      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture of the test. Let me improve its understandability by:\n1. Removing the large collection of unused data-provider methods that have no `@ParameterizedTest` consumers in this file\n2. Removing unused imports\n3. Extracting named variables for the period arguments to make intent clearNow let me compile-check the test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes ~130 lines of unused data-provider methods and imports, and replaces the two terse inline assertions with named variables (`oneMonth`, `oct12_1752`, `expectedSep23_1752`, etc.) and a brief comment explaining why the cutover-era subtraction lands on Sep 23."
